DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270124
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270128
SUMMARY:NetSci-X 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:NetSciX: International School and Conference on Network Science
 \nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://netsci
 x2027.github.io/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#net
 sci-x-2027\nNotes: Official site\, NSS event page and EasyChair CFP confi
 rm January 24-27\, 2027 (school and conference) at the Sheraton Hong Kong
 \, Tsim Sha Tsui. Two-page extended abstracts are due October 31\, 2026\,
  23:59 AoE (site-wide AoE rule)\, after extensions to October 10 and then
  October 31\; submissions opened September 1. EasyChair's login page said
  new submissions were open on 2026-10-31. No proceedings are announced. O
 nline participation (keynotes\, invited talks\, selected tracks) costs 15
 % of the regular fee. Special focus: Network Science meets AI. NSS winter
  meeting\, distinct from NetSci. Size M: smaller winter companion of NetS
 ci\; NetSciX 2026 was mostly single-track. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Complex Systems & Network Science,Graphs & Graph Learning,Nonlin
 ear Dynamics & Chaos
URL:https://netscix2027.github.io/
LOCATION:Hong Kong\, China
